   "summary": "The law amended section 41(h)(1) of title 35 to raise the fee reduction from 50 percent to 60 percent, and amended section 41(h)(3) to raise the electronic filing fee reduction from 75 percent to 80 percent [2022-117-328-41-1] [2022-117-328-41-2]. It also added section 41(j) and section 123(f) of title 35, each requiring a fine of at least 3 times the unpaid amount for false claims or certifications of entitlement [2022-117-328-41-3] [2022-117-328-123-1].",
